sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (PWA Client)
    participant ClientDb as Client SQLite / IndexedDB
    participant Gateway as WebGateway (HttpPayloadTelemetry)
    participant VisionSvc as Nutrition.VisionService
    participant AgentAI as Microsoft Agent (Gemini 3-Flash / 2.5)
    participant MemoryDb as SQLite (UserCorrectionRecords)
    participant AnalyticsSvc as Nutrition.AnalyticsService
    participant LedgerDb as SQLite Ledger (Universal UTC Converter)
    participant DiaryUI as Food Diary (Card / Grid / Excel Export)

    User->>ClientDb: Snap Meal Photo or Enter Text Description
    alt Device is Offline
        ClientDb-->>User: Cache Photo / Meal (Status: PendingSync)
    else Device is Online
        ClientDb->>Gateway: POST /api/meals/upload or /analyze-text
        Gateway->>Gateway: Validate Magic Bytes, Strip EXIF & Enforce Rate Limits
        Gateway->>Gateway: Start Activity 'POST /api/meals/...' with Body Telemetry
        Gateway->>VisionSvc: Forward Sanitized Stream / Description
        VisionSvc->>VisionSvc: Start Span 'ai.food_detection' with GenAI Tags
        VisionSvc->>AgentAI: Analyze Meal (Structured Prompt + Quantity Multiplier + Fallback Cascade)
        AgentAI-->>VisionSvc: IndianMealAnalysisResult (6 Macros, Portion Multipliers, detectedByModel)
        VisionSvc-->>Gateway: HTTP 200 (Parsed Items, Calories, Protein, Carbs, Fat, Fiber, Sugar)
        
        alt Confidence Score >= 70%
            Gateway-->>User: Render Review Modal (Quantity Input, 6-Macro Mini-Pills, Model Badge)
            opt User edits Quantity / Portion / Items
                User->>User: Update Quantity (e.g. 1.0 -> 1.5)
                User->>User: Instant Reactive Recalculation across all 6 Macros + Cooking Fat
                User->>Gateway: POST /api/meals/confirm (with modified items)
                Gateway->>MemoryDb: Persist UserCorrectionRecord (Continuous Learning Memory)
            end
            User->>Gateway: POST /api/meals/confirm (Tap 'Looks Great!')
            Gateway->>LedgerDb: Persist MealLog (UTC Timestamp via ValueConverter)
            Gateway->>AnalyticsSvc: Emit MealConfirmedEvent
            AnalyticsSvc->>LedgerDb: Update DailyCalorieLedger (Fiber 30g & Sugar 25g Tracking)
            AnalyticsSvc-->>User: Trigger Confetti Micro-Burst & Streak +1
            AnalyticsSvc->>DiaryUI: Refresh Food Diary (Card / Grid Views)
        else Confidence Score < 70%
            VisionSvc-->>Gateway: HTTP 422 (Low Confidence Alert)
            Gateway-->>User: Show Friendly Retake Prompt & 1-Tap Retake Button
            opt User prefers manual
                User->>Gateway: POST /api/meals/quick-manual
            end
        end
    end

    opt User Manages Food Diary
        User->>DiaryUI: Select Period (1D, 7D, 30D, 90D, 365D) or Switch Card/Grid View
        DiaryUI-->>User: Display Formatted Meal History with 6-Macro Badges & Timezone Conversion
        opt User Exports Data
            User->>DiaryUI: Click 'Export to Excel'
            DiaryUI-->>User: Download Structured .csv / .xlsx Sheet
        end
        opt User Deletes Meal
            User->>DiaryUI: Click Delete Button on Meal
            DiaryUI-->>User: Show Custom Obsidian Delete Modal (Danger Pulse & Deficit Advisory)
            User->>Gateway: DELETE /api/meals/{id}
            Gateway->>LedgerDb: Remove MealLog
            Gateway->>AnalyticsSvc: Recalculate Ledger for Circadian Day
            AnalyticsSvc-->>User: Update Daily HUD & Refresh Diary View
        end
    end
